{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:92f5643fdf7f0bae8066a8c7fb603a7146e2052749daae25d4cead580a1f32e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d41125dca84a51341c1b9ce628a53a7a8d553abeeb079f6579d40a35e6498412",
      "text": "突然收到“挑战书”，\n两位没有感到动摇吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5154620bc0d5eb7dbaa36c0bfe121c3376b9cd3835b481b799f47b0ad4c60db4",
      "text": "嗯—，毕竟都是大叔了嘛。\n区区这点小事还不至于动摇啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f63e0ee53e1019e44c9621f30ed759c401ddfb84e24460b42ef3a9772068cf4b",
      "text": "是啊，虽说也有上了年纪的缘故……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e125f460915661c8f520ad058f1be9bb4329be647c76aa1506f0470a651b70e",
      "text": "不过待在这家事务所里，\n每天尽是些新鲜事呢。早就习惯了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f57e2a0a0d16324c558b57a4d63a4e24156f812a59b67bcf5f5f51c968c6398",
      "text": "况且托JIF的福，\n所有人作为偶像应该都积累了很棒的经验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2626a049e5cb6c06715e07748f666c3945f54da56fe6b92c44ab2d04c3e64baf",
      "text": "这次肯定也能挺过去的。\n毕竟还有你在嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:006c625c542acad31b4d7a941f4ad875edfe693c266fb3b8bddd1f37ef6130fa",
      "text": "没错没错，只要大家都在这次也没问题！\n所以，现在二次聚会才是最优先的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d88b093523acd5e8b9f2fe4b011612036539820218173bb4ac93cfbb4387270",
      "text": "得好好慰劳一下彼此的辛劳呢。……所以说，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱也来二次聚会对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b1d93a6e88aba2d0987ebbccbcc02c710c1b6953eaa24d6e95e1f404a4a000f",
      "text": "谢谢大家。请让我参加！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a833a206e2f50ce8a3e611acd72516a4c5159a0a8c2309ac84c176f12d0c734c",
      "text": "好，那就这么定了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18120e5644b4f63950f7272171c457bb9c8f501de5f41805eed33518d4d4b991",
      "text": "那么，剩下的清理工作就赶快利落地搞定吧！\n我们也会帮忙的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000085:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000095:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0917752c90f25564de67dcb4a3082723806cb285765e1662659ae068b6a60a7c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n二次聚会的店找到了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000097:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d59902440f7d96de35393019658bd4d7c894c1ad49e965e53622630f0c23e08",
      "text": "我先过去了，\n收拾完之后大家一起过来好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000099:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a32bb67aaaab94082f94bea8bb59e59213d83cb622de5c46b1bd42c3f21ec28f",
      "text": "地点我发消息给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000101:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d53f13713330cf0c369a1dec6809f1385be8b229b30862101923e9e01917021",
      "text": "关于男极的事情…",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000103:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5ffcd6f585184228b6e8a7f5400794956bf7a493dcd9d9dfef350be8f863e9c",
      "text": "难道是，挑战书的事？\n我当然也有一些想法啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000105:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9012d9e237878c3e06c6644145ceb593b3103c90a7bce1e2fb9c1657e283c4e4",
      "text": "但比起那个，现在好好慰劳\n●●●●プロデューサー才是最重要的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000107:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4afb89f3caf06c291bb11a759fc50a2de51ec6d9ad3349b8bad026cf68b4d3d0",
      "text": "我也会好好慰劳大家的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000109:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d29fae445edeb0f003a9a35dcf8bdf98c086d747a47622e284f1fb1a0144da3a",
      "text": "啊哈哈，我就知道你会这么说。\n那我们就互相慰劳，尽情享受二次聚会吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000111:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:922bd43caac8247d739784595e50997a8a035e5b85f16087f3bb9c8a3d013ba4",
      "text": "啊，到店里了。\n我先进去在座位上等你们哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000113:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b317823ef29a55275b1f56fe8eddab812debe393ba15e7394e483094e9eda71d",
      "text": "待会儿再慢慢聊。先这样啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
